@startuml
title LMCache MP NPU 适配关键类关系
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

interface DeviceSpec
class NpuDeviceSpec
DeviceSpec <|.. NpuDeviceSpec

abstract class DeviceIPCWrapper
class NpuIPCWrapper
DeviceIPCWrapper <|-- NpuIPCWrapper
NpuIPCWrapper o-- "1..*" PlaneRecord : stores

abstract class EventIPCBackend
class NpuEventIPCBackend
EventIPCBackend <|-- NpuEventIPCBackend

abstract class BaseCacheContext
class NpuCacheContext
BaseCacheContext <|-- NpuCacheContext
NpuCacheContext *-- KVLayerGroupsManager : owns
NpuCacheContext *-- "1..*" NpuIPCWrapper : imports
NpuCacheContext *-- "1..*" PointerTable : builds
NpuCacheContext *-- TransferStream : owns

class LMCacheDrivenTransferContext
class EngineDrivenTransferContext
LMCacheDrivenTransferContext ..> NpuEventIPCBackend : event IPC
LMCacheDrivenTransferContext ..> NpuCacheContext : server registration
EngineDrivenTransferContext ..> NpuDeviceSpec : device routing

class NpuDeviceOps
NpuDeviceSpec ..> NpuDeviceOps : binds native/fallback ops
NpuCacheContext ..> NpuDeviceOps : transfer calls
NpuDeviceOps ..> execute_object_group_transfer : native fast path
NpuDeviceOps ..> TorchOps : fallback

class KVLayerGroupsManager
KVLayerGroupsManager ..> EngineKVFormat : discovers groups
NpuCacheContext ..> EngineKVFormat : format 13/16/17

class PlaneRecord {
  handle
  dtype
  shape
  stride
  storage_offset
}
class PointerTable {
  NPU int64[ ]
}
class TransferStream
class EngineKVFormat {
  NL_X_TWO_X_NB_BS_HS = 17
}
class execute_object_group_transfer
class TorchOps

note right of NpuIPCWrapper
每层一个 wrapper；
单 plane 返回 Tensor，
多 plane 返回 tuple
end note

note right of NpuCacheContext
注册阶段：import → discover →
group → pointer table → staging → stream
end note
@enduml
